  "description": "Cryptographically secure, zero-dependency generation of numeric passcodes (OTP), alphanumeric and human-readable codes, voucher and license keys, API keys, random integers and secret keys for .NET Standard 1.3+ and every .NET LTS release.",
  "id": "Fayakun.Security.Passcodes",
