  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "v1.2.0\n- New targets: netstandard1.3, netstandard2.0 (.NET Framework 4.6.2+) and netcoreapp3.1.\n- New: SecureKeyGenerator.GenerateBytes, GenerateHexKey (lowercase option), GenerateBase64Key, GenerateBase64UrlKey and GenerateApiKey (prefixed base62 keys).\n- New: PasscodeGenerator.GenerateFormattedCode (custom alphabet/separator) and Span-based FillPasscode overload.\n- New: CharacterSets.LowercaseAlphabetic and CharacterSets.Base62.\n- Uses RandomNumberGenerator.GetItems / GetString on .NET 8+ and a shared RNG instance on older targets.\n- Fix: GenerateRandomNumberInclusive now supports int.MaxValue as the upper bound.\n- Fix: null prefixes now throw ArgumentNullException instead of NullReferenceException.",
